# Frequency conversion between kilohertz and terahertz

Verifies direct conversion between kilohertz and terahertz in both directions. Kilohertz converts to the coarser unit through decimal promotion and four-place rounding, while terahertz converts exactly to kilohertz.

>>> source
forward_whole: int = 1khz
print(forward_whole->to(thz))
forward_fractional: decimal = 1.5khz
print(forward_fractional->to(thz))
backward_whole: int = 1thz
print(backward_whole->to(khz))
backward_fractional: decimal = 1.5thz
print(backward_fractional->to(khz))

<<< stdout
0.0000thz
0.0000thz
1000000000khz
1500000000.0khz

<<< stderr
